    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Michael Pigott Auctioneer & Valuer proudly offers for sale this sublime three-bedroom semi-detached home presented in showhouse condition situated in the ever popular Forest Hill development in Carrigaline. \r\n\r\nThe property benefits hugely from occupying a quiet south-facing cul-de-sac and enjoying an enviable position overlooking a large green area to the front, this property offers a wonderful sense of space, privacy and natural light that sets it apart from many similar homes in the development. Unlike many properties in the estate, it is far less overlooked, making it an ideal choice for families and buyers seeking a peaceful setting.\r\n\r\nThis beautifully maintained home has been lovingly cared for and upgraded by its current owners with many high quality features and finishes evident throughout the home. Every room reflects a high standard of finish, tasteful décor and meticulous attention to detail, allowing the new owners to simply move in and enjoy.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property features an attractive combination of smooth plaster finish, red brick detailing and granite window sills. The cobble-lock driveway provides comfortable off-street parking for two cars and includes an outdoor power socket. There is gated side access leading to the rear garden, features a patio, lawn area, outdoor tap and additional external power socket—perfect for outdoor dining, entertaining or family life.\r\n\r\nInside, the accommodation is bright, spacious and thoughtfully designed. The welcoming entrance hallway leads to a beautifully presented living room with an inset gas fireplace, while the open-plan kitchen and dining area forms the heart of the home with direct access to the rear garden. A separate utility room and guest WC complete the ground floor. Upstairs are three generously proportioned bedrooms, all with built-in wardrobes, including a spacious principal bedroom with en-suite, together with a well-appointed family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe property has an impressive B2 BER rating and benefits from solar panels, fibre broadband connected directly to the home, a full alarm system, wheelchair accessibility, PVC double-glazed windows and doors, and a semi-floored attic with Stira folding stairs providing excellent additional storage.\r\n\r\nForest Hill is one of Carrigaline’s most sought-after residential developments, offering a superb family-friendly environment within walking distance of the town centre. Carrigaline provides an excellent range of schools, shops, cafés, restaurants, sporting clubs and healthcare facilities, while Cork Airport, Ringaskiddy, Mahon and Cork City are all within easy commuting distance. Regular public transport is also available nearby. \r\n\r\nViewing of this impeccable quality home with endless features comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 5.5m x 2.0m \r\nPorcelain tiled floor, carpeted staircase, decorative coving, centre light, under-stairs storage, large wall mirror, radiator cover, curtain pole and alarm control panel.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 4.0m x 3.8m \r\nCarpet flooring, decorative coving, feature chandelier, marble fireplace with inset gas fire, large wall mirror, TV and telephone points, window blind and curtain pole.\r\n\r\nGuest WC - \r\nPorcelain tiled floor, WC, WHB, wall mirror, centre light and decorative shelving.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Room - 5.9m x 3.0m \r\nPorcelain tiled floor, contemporary fitted kitchen with double ceramic sink, integrated dishwasher, oven, gas hob and stainless-steel extractor hood. Tiled splashback, decorative coving, centre lights, window blind, curtain pole and PVC door to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nUtility Room - 2.9m x 1.4m \r\nPorcelain tiled floor, fitted storage units, plumbed for washing machine and tumble dryer, tiled splashback, centre light and window blind.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor - \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.7m x 3.5m \r\nCarpet flooring, large built-in wardrobe, TV and telephone points, window blind and curtain pole.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite - 2.7m x 1.0m \r\nTiled floor and shower area, power shower with enclosure, WC, WHB, large wall mirror, mirrored storage unit, overhead lighting, centre globe light and window blind.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.9m x 3.0m \r\nCarpet flooring, built-in wardrobe, window blind, curtain pole and centre light.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.8m x 2.7m \r\nCarpet flooring, large fitted sliderobe with lighting, fitted dressing table/study desk with illuminated mirror, telephone point, window blind and centre light.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom - 2.2m x 1.9m \r\nTiled floor and bath surround, bath with overhead electric shower and enclosure, WC, WHB, large wall mirror with overhead lighting, window blind and centre globe light.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Size: 103 sq metres (1,107 sq ft)\r\nGas Fired Zoned Central Heating with solar panels for hot water\r\nPVC Double Glazed Windows & Doors\r\nExceptional quiet cul-de-sac location overlooking a large green area\r\nImmaculate turnkey condition throughout\r\nB2 BER rating\r\nFully alarmed \r\nWheelchair accessible\r\nFloored attic with Stira folding stairs\r\nCobble-lock driveway with parking for two cars\r\nSide access to rear garden\r\nOutdoor tap and external power points to front and rear\r\nWalking distance to Carrigaline town centre\r\nExcellent access to Cork Airport, Ringaskiddy, Mahon & Cork City"
      },
