      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Cork, continue into Carrigaline. Head towards Crosshaven and take the first turn right before Kilnagleary Business Park. Forest Hill is situated at the top of this road. Upon entering the estate, take your first left downhill and and your 2nd left again. Continue on this road, taking the 2nd right hand turn, signposted for Holly Vale. At the bottom of the hill, follow the road around to the right driving towards the end and the property is located on the right handside, indicated by our \"For Sale\" sign. Follow Eircode P43 H397"
